WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:07.000
It is difficult to say... What if Father himself had a personal stake in the embezzled silver?

00:10.360 --> 00:14.000
You dare imply... that because the Chen clan embezzled, Zhen embezzled as well?!

00:15.160 --> 00:21.500
Enough! Siring a son like you must be how Zhen repays the wrath of heaven!

00:21.680 --> 00:27.000
Get out! Get out of my sight! Zhen never wants to lay eyes on you again!

00:30.680 --> 00:32.000
As Father commands...

00:33.000 --> 00:43.000
In the 18th year of Yuankang, Prince of Jin Sikong Yao fell from imperial favor and was banished to the southern frontier. En route, his vessel mysteriously sprang a leak and capsized in the river.
